secubox-grafana (1.0.7-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Apply dual-vhost MUST pattern (docs/MODULE-GUIDELINES.md §4):
    /grafana/ on the canonical hub vhost is now `alias /usr/share/
    secubox/www/grafana/` (static admin page), no longer a proxy to
    the Grafana LXC. NEW dedicated vhost
    `/etc/nginx/sites-available/grafana.conf` for
    `grafana.gk2.secubox.in` (Authelia-gated) serves the real Grafana
    UI at the root path so its absolute asset URLs resolve.
  * Operator-side prerequisites for the new vhost: DNS record + TLS
    cert + HAProxy ACL + mitmproxy route (documented in
    nginx/grafana-vhost.conf header).
  * grafanactl emit_access_json: real Grafana URLs — lan
    `http://10.100.0.70:3000/` + public `https://grafana.gk2.secubox.in/`.
    Default PUBLIC_HOSTNAME -> grafana.gk2.secubox.in.
  * grafanactl config_get strips TOML inline comments. cmd_status
    `""|""` duplicate pattern fixed to `""|list`.
  * www/grafana/index.html: "native UI" button reads from /access.
  * Grafana INI inside the LXC needs `serve_from_sub_path = false`
    + `root_url = https://grafana.gk2.secubox.in/` for the new vhost;
    update install-lxc.sh accordingly on next install/reload.

