secubox-grafana (1.0.5-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * .service: prefix ExecStartPre mkdir/chown with '+' (run as root) — they
    fail when the unit runs as User=secubox and try to chown a dir.
  * nginx/grafana.conf: switch the /api/v1/<m>/ location from
    proxy_pass http://unix:.../sock:/ to explicit rewrite + bare socket URL
    (matches the canonical pattern used by secubox-users — the previous
    syntax did NOT strip the /api/v1/<m>/ prefix, so the FastAPI app saw
    the full path and returned 404 on every route).

 -- Gerald KERMA <devel@cybermind.fr>  Wed, 20 May 2026 13:30:00 +0200

